OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric bridge to close to
OL,4,Atraffic for major repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian swivel bridge will be
OL,7,Fclosing to traffic to enable essential
OL,8,Frepairs to be carried out.
OL,10,FPrince Street Bridge, built in 1879,
OL,11,Fwill be closed to all vehicles from 7
OL,12,FDecember until summer 2027, according
OL,13,Fto Bristol City Council.
OL,15,FThe #465,000 project will focus on
OL,16,Frepairing and upgrading the Grade
OL,17,FII-listed bridge's swing mechanism, the
OL,18,Fcontrol systems and restoration work to
OL,19,Fthe historic pumphouse.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
