OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric bridge to close to
OL,4,Atraffic for major repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Andrew Brown, chair of the
OL,7,FHarbour Committee, said the work would
OL,8,F"preserve important heritage assets"
OL,9,Fwhile ensuring they remain safe for
OL,10,Ffuture generations.
